{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1220337-astral-space-dreams-inspirations","id":1220337,"title":"Astral Space / Dreams inspirations","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-05-19T14:40:50-07:00","id":1220337,"title":"Astral Space / Dreams inspirations","content":"As both <b>Mage</b> and <b>Beast</b> use direct Astral Space - that in <b>Beast</b> is called 'Dreams' - I think that combined topic for inspirations for exploring the same stuff is in order in general forum. Probably <b>Changeling</b> can use this stuff also, but Lost operates on slightly different cosmological... hmmm, perspective (?) on the matter. I just want to point that setting and rules for <b>Mage</b> are in <b>Astral Realms</b> book and for <b>Beast</b> are in <b>Beast Players Guide</b>. <b>Astral Realms </b>as solely dedicated to subject is much more comprehensible on topic. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Quick run down of Astral Space terminology - first <b>Mage</b>, then <b>Beast</b> term:<ul><li><b>Oneiros / Personal Dream</b> (?) - World of inner memories and persons urges. 'Your' world.</li> <li><b>Temeons / Bright Dream</b> - Dream worlds of various concepts shared by humanity - religions, political views, mythologies, even celebrities lives as myths. If more than two people have strong feelings or thoughts on subject - it has Temenos realm to explore.</li> <li><b>Primordial Dream</b> - Far end of Temenos where Beasts Horrors live and have Lairs. It's realms of humanity primal fears.</li> <li><b>Anima Mundi / Mother's Land</b> - Realm of soul-dreams of whole Earth, without humanity - trees, water, stones, animals or even stars. Most primal of all realms. Beasts believe it's from here their Dark Mother comes.</li> </ul>So here are mine classic inspirations for running Astral Realms / Dreams stories:<br /> <br /> <b>Inception</b> (Movie) - Film about literal people going into dreams to hack the minds is must watch for Astral Space.<br /> <br /> <b>Inside Out</b> (Movie) - Very good animation of how Personal Dream / Oneiros could look like in teenage girl. 'Emotions' are here Daimons, each pulling here in different direction. Very fun and moving picture.<br /> <br /> <b>Psychonauts </b>( Video Game ) - Protagonist Raz uses his psychic powers to enter the mindscape of some very eccentric people are excellent inspiration for stories focused on exploring Oneiroi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-20-2018, 12:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T14:46:04-07:00","id":1220341,"title":"","content":"Latest <b>Steven Universe </b>episode - 'A Single Pale Rose' - is greatly showing Oneiros switching of scenes/memories. ( And is crucial to main plot, so watch out for spoilers. ) <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-19-2018, 06:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"r